{"sectionId":"endocrine/overview","items":[{"id":"endocrine--overview-k001","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"펩타이드 호르몬은 대체로 preprohormone으로 합성되어 소낭에 저장되고 막수용체를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k002","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"스테로이드 호르몬은 cholesterol에서 합성되고 주로 세포 내 수용체를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k003","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"catecholamine은 아미노산 유도체로 막수용체, 갑상샘 호르몬은 아미노산 유도체지만 핵수용체를 주로 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k004","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"혈중 운반단백질과 결합하는 호르몬은 자유형 농도와 총농도를 구별해야 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k005","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"시상하부 TRH는 TSH, CRH는 ACTH, GnRH는 FSH/LH, GHRH는 GH 분비를 촉진한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k006","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"somatostatin은 GH 및 TSH를 억제할 수 있고 dopamine은 prolactin을 긴장성 억제한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k007","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"뇌하수체 전엽은 TSH,ACTH,FSH,LH,GH,PRL을 합성·분비한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k008","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"후엽의 ADH와 oxytocin은 시상하부의 시각위핵(supraoptic nucleus)과 실방핵(paraventricular nucleus)","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k009","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"등에서 합성되어 축삭으로 이동한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k010","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"GH는 직접 대사 작용과 간 등의 IGF-1 유도를 통해 성장에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k011","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"oxytocin은 자궁수축·젖 사출, prolactin은 젖 생성에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k012","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"ADH 합성: 시상하부 시각위핵·실방핵; 분비: 뇌하수체 후엽. 시각교차상핵과 혼동하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k013","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"PRL은 dopamine 억제, GH는 GHRH 촉진과 somatostatin 억제.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k014","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"ACTH는 부신피질 cortisol 분비를 촉진한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k015","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"음성 피드백은 축의 과도한 활성화를 제한한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--overview-k016","sectionId":"endocrine/overview","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"Prolactin과 oxytocin이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}